---
layout: base.njk
wide: true
title: "The Museum of Work"
search_title: "The Museum of Work: jobs, rules and arrangements AI made obsolete"
description: "A museum of jobs, rules and working arrangements that stopped making sense once machines could think cheaply. Each exhibit is an obituary: born, a life, the decline, the survivors."
permalink: /museum/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<header class="museum-head">
  <p class="kicker">Permanent collection · free entry · no gift shop</p>
  <h1>The Museum of Work</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">Jobs, rules and ways of earning a living that stopped making sense once thinking got cheap. Each one is kept here with its dates and a notice of its death. Some were loved. Some were only ever a way of making people wait. Please do not tap the glass.</p>
</header>

<ol class="exhibits" reversed>
{%- set total = collections.kind_obituaries | length %}
{%- for post in collections.kind_obituaries %}
  {%- set x = post.data.title | exhibit %}
  <li class="exhibit">
    <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">
      {%- if post.data.artwork %}
      <img src="{{ ('/art/' + post.data.artwork.thumb) | url }}" alt="{{ post.data.artwork.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
      {%- endif %}
      <span class="exhibit-no">WE.{{ post.date.getUTCFullYear() }}.{{ (total - loop.index0) | pad(3) }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-name">{{ x.name }}</span>
      {%- if x.dates %}<span class="exhibit-dates">{{ x.dates }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="exhibit-card">{{ post.data.description | whole }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-acq">Acquired {{ post.date | readable }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>

<p class="eyebrow section-gap">A new exhibit arrives most Saturdays. The museum takes jobs before rules, and prefers the ones somebody will miss.</p>
